gns. But if there were a way to determine which campaigns would be extremely successful \u2013 and could theoretically be even more successful with the right publicity on their end \u2013 Kickstarter would find this information extremely valuable. We could also provide a service to a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":181440,"global_rank":410296},{"name":"ShreyansPatell/ShreyansPatell","owner":"ShreyansPatell","html_url":"https://github.com/ShreyansPatell/ShreyansPatell","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Config files for my GitHub profile.","topics":["config","github-config"],"score":181440,"global_rank":410297},{"name":"burcu-erkan/hover-time","owner":"burcu-erkan","html_url":"https://github.com/burcu-erkan/hover-time","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Created with CodeSandbox","topics":[],"score":181440,"global_rank":410298},{"name":"mi4l/Zero","owner":"mi4l","html_url":"https://github.com/mi4l/Zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"TODO app for desktop/mobile","topics":[],"score":181440,"global_rank":410299},{"name":"sigsegved/CCN-Simulator","owner":"sigsegved","html_url":"https://github.com/sigsegved/CCN-Simulator","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"The simulation system contains two processes. The packet process, which will simulate the complete experience of a packet. The packet process is the complete lifecycle of any packet starting from the node its born to reaching the destination node. The packet process will be able to simulate both interest and data packet experience. It can clone, time out and route itself to destination.   The other process in the system would be the generator process, which wakes up after a particular time and generates a random interest packet. The Generator process will assign a random node as the birth node and an object ID that belongs to another node. Generator process then activates this packet and puts itself to sleep for a random time. ","topics":[],"score":181438,"global_rank":410300},{"name":"arnellebalane/Pagination","owner":"arnellebalane","html_url":"https://github.com/arnellebalane/Pagination","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"PHP","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181435,"global_rank":410313},{"name":"pooja-choudhari/SQL-Challeges-Projects-","owner":"pooja-choudhari","html_url":"https://github.com/pooja-choudhari/SQL-Challeges-Projects-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"This repository contains all the SQL challenges and projects done from various resources for learning purpose. ","topics":[],"score":181433,"global_rank":410314},{"name":"Marcostrejo23/Marcostrejo23","owner":"Marcostrejo23","html_url":"https://github.com/Marcostrejo23/Marcostrejo23","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181433,"global_rank":410315},{"name":"Es7evam/Presentations","owner":"Es7evam","html_url":"https://github.com/Es7evam/Presentations","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"My presentations and workshops. English or Portuguese","topics":[],"score":181433,"global_rank":410316},{"name":"peakcm/sle_ericson","owner":"peakcm","html_url":"https://github.com/peakcm/sle_ericson","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"SLE mobility project using Ericson data","topics":[],"score":181433,"global_rank":410319},{"name":"HermanDhak/Process-Dispatcher","owner":"HermanDhak","html_url":"https://github.com/HermanDhak/Process-Dispatcher","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Process dispatcher simulator with 4 priority levels and resource management","topics":[],"scor